{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/about/layout,_N_T_/about/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/about/[slug]/page,_N_T_/about/2025-12-10-airport-5-30-am"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/about/$d$slug/__PAGE__","/about/$d$slug","/about","/_index","/_head"]},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--Q5K0UX1dTfp8SZPg_L6Wj--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/70bc3e132a0a741e-s.p.15008bfb.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/83afe278b6a6bb3c-s.p.3a6ba036.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/330a17ddee87f907.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/20d1a56625def336.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/806bdb8e4a6a9b95.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3a7ba59533961d35.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/d702a24e2b6c48fa.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-53420ca41719f304.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/7c92e96509cd355e.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>Personal Portfolio</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Crafting code, capturing light, and making some noise.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.0b3bf435.ico\" sizes=\"256x256\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/a6dad97d9634a72d.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"inter_5901b7c6-module__ec5Qua__variable jetbrains_mono_8be3b53a-module__CxiPNW__variable antialiased relative min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 pointer-events-none grainy opacity-20\"></div><main class=\"relative z-10 min-h-screen flex flex-col\"><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#060606] text-neutral-400 font-light selection:bg-white selection:text-black pb-32\"><header class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-40 p-6 grid grid-cols-3 items-center bg-[#060606]/80 backdrop-blur-sm border-b border-neutral-900/50\"><div class=\"flex justify-start\"><a href=\"/about\"><span class=\"group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 font-sans transition-colors duration-300 text-sm text-neutral-500 hover:text-white\"><span class=\"mr-2 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">[</span><span class=\"tracking-widest uppercase\">&lt; Back</span><span class=\"ml-2 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">]</span></span></a></div><div class=\"flex justify-center\"><h1 class=\"text-[10px] md:text-xs font-normal tracking-[0.4em] text-neutral-500 uppercase\">Monologue</h1></div><div class=\"flex justify-end invisible md:visible\"><div class=\"w-16\"></div></div></header><main class=\"pt-48 px-6 md:px-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><header class=\"mb-24 space-y-8\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-600 tracking-[0.3em]\">DECEMBER 9, 2025</div><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-light tracking-tight text-neutral-100 leading-tight uppercase\">Airport, 5:30 AM</h1><div class=\"w-12 h-px bg-neutral-800\"></div></header><article class=\"prose prose-invert max-w-none\"><div class=\"text-neutral-400 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed font-light space-y-12 whitespace-pre-wrap\">The airport is a magical place.\n\nPeople meet and part, sprint and wait. Look—there’s a man with a guitar, adding a silent background track to his own journey. There’s another with a bouquet, glancing around, wondering when his luck will finally land. And someone else, lugging a massive suitcase and buying a neck pillow, perhaps waking up on the other side of the ocean.\n\nFates intertwine, then sever. This is likely the first time you’ll brush shoulders with him, and the last. These fleeting encounters create a peculiar energy field, one that allows me to detach from my &quot;subject&quot; self and observe—inward or outward—as an &quot;object.&quot;\n\nStep through the gate, put on the eye mask, pick a random loading animation, and let your memories save. Don&#x27;t fear the turbulence; it’s just the new terrain loading.\n\n&quot;Could I have a coffee, please?&quot; I wonder if this flicker of heart palpitations is from the caffeine or the anticipation of seeing a new flame—or an old love. Then I realize: it’s the greedy timeline stretching out, rooting itself like a tree into every corner of the universe. That feeling of weightlessness? That’s me falling into a new abyss of time. I didn&#x27;t jump; I slipped. How could I ever be prepared, especially when met by that gentle, drowsy voice asking, &quot;Chicken rice or pasta?&quot;\n\nMy thorned time capsule rests quietly outside the window. The bold print on its manual—&quot;PIT 6:00 AM&quot;—reminds me that this abyss is one I dove into of my own volition.\n\n&quot;What could be wrong&quot; has become my mantra lately. I can always find a reason to do something.\n\nSo I wait, then I run. Once I find a reason I truly believe in, I set off.\n\nA new journey begins.</div></article><footer class=\"mt-32 pt-16 border-t border-neutral-900 flex justify-end items-center\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-700 tracking-widest uppercase\">End of Passage</div></footer></main></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/20d1a56625def336.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/sta