ike a tree into every corner of the universe. That feeling of weightlessness? That’s me falling into a new abyss of time. I didn't jump; I slipped. How could I ever be prepared, especially when met by that gentle, drowsy voice asking, \"Chicken rice or pasta?\"\n\nMy thorned time capsule rests quietly outside the window. The bold print on its manual—\"PIT 6:00 AM\"—reminds me that this abyss is one I dove into of my own volition.\n\n\"What could be wrong\" has become my mantra lately. I can always find a reason to do something.\n\nSo I wait, then I run. Once I find a reason I truly believe in, I set off.\n\nA new journey begins.0:{\"buildId\":\"Q5K0UX1dTfp8SZPg-L6Wj\",\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-h-screen bg-[#060606] text-neutral-400 font-light selection:bg-white selection:text-black pb-32\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"header\",null,{\"className\":\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-40 p-6 grid grid-cols-3 items-center bg-[#060606]/80 backdrop-blur-sm border-b border-neutral-900/50\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex justify-start\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"href\":\"/about\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 font-sans transition-colors duration-300 text-sm text-neutral-500 hover:text-white\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mr-2 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\",\"children\":\"[\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"tracking-widest uppercase\",\"children\":\"< Back\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-2 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\",\"children\":\"]\"}]]}]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex justify-center\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[10px] md:text-xs font-normal tracking-[0.4em] text-neutral-500 uppercase\",\"children\":\"Monologue\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex justify-end i